---
description: Product Strategist workflow and safety rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository workflow and safety constraints in `AGENTS.md`.
Load the relevant procedure from `skills/` when performing a skill-specific
task. The IDE agent is the workflow orchestrator; Python scripts are
deterministic tools only.

Before resuming, read `state/workflow_state.json` and continue from its next
action without repeating completed work. Before presenting a strategy, run the
evidence validator.

Adversarial review must be performed by a separate subagent/context with only
the brief and finalized evidence/options/strategy artifacts. Do not provide
the review subagent the strategy-generation chat, hidden reasoning, or draft
history.
